  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Develoment of Uganda Retirement Benefits Regulatory Auth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Task Description Institutional Development of the Uganda Retirement Benefits Regulatory Authority - URBRA  Development Objective of the Project The overall objective of the proposed activity is to develop the institutional capacity within URBRA in order for the newly created institution to regulate and supervise the pension sector and to license market participants. The activity will focus on supporting the initial setup of URBRA, including the development of in-house technical capacity to start its operation in the short term. Comments on grant approval process Comments on process of mobilizing trust funds and grants Comments on Financing Plan OK</narrative>
  </description>
